Before creating page-local header, footer, legal, support, privacy, or refund navigation, inspect shared ownership in `PublicShell`, `PublicHeaderContainer`, `PublicHeader`, and `PublicFooter`. Do not duplicate site-wide chrome when the shared owner already provides it.

